      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NEVERTELLMETHEODDS (9) found form and finished second two runs ago then came back to earth when he broke and finished a long last over 2100m at Bunbury. Hard to know where he gets from this slightly awkward draw. Meets a similar line up so he is sure to be a force if the manners improve. TWOHEARTONEDIAMOND (8) turned in a much better run last time out, finishing second over 1730m at Gloucester Park. May need luck at some stage extracting from the inside of the second row. Finds a suitable assignment and will take plenty of beating once more. CRACKA TINNY (4) is the next elect off a last-start win by 1.5 metres at Northam over 2190m. SHES MY LITTLE GEM (2) is worth some thought despite her last-start sixth over 2190m at Northam on August 22.",
